#: about/aboutpage.cpp:95
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "KPlato is intended for managing moderately large projects with multiple "
#| "resources. To enable you to model your project adequately, KPlato offers "
#| "different types of task dependencies and timing constraints. Usually you "
#| "will define your tasks, estimate the effort needed to perform each task, "
#| "allocate resources and then schedule the project according to the "
#| "dependency network and resource availability.<p>You can find more "
#| "information in the <a href=\"help:kplato\">documentation</a> or online at "
#| "<a href=\"http://www.koffice.org/kplato\">http://www.koffice.org/kplato</"
#| "a></p>"
msgid ""
"Plan is intended for managing moderately large projects with multiple "
"resources. To enable you to model your project adequately, Plan offers "
"different types of task dependencies and timing constraints. Usually you "
"will define your tasks, estimate the effort needed to perform each task, "
"allocate resources and then schedule the project according to the dependency "
"network and resource availability.<p>You can find more information in the <a "
"href=\"help:plan\">documentation</a> or online at <a href=\"http://www."
"calligra-suite.org/plan\">http://www.calligra-suite.org/plan</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"KPlato está pensado para xestionar proxectos moderadamente grandes con "
"varios recursos. Con finde de lle permitir modelar o seu proxecto dun xeito "
"adecuado KPlato admite diferentes tipos de dependencias de tarefas e "
"constricións temporais. Normalmente terá que definir tarefas, estimar o "
"esforzo que se precisa para cada tarefa, asignar os recursos e logo axustar "
"un calendario para o seu proxecto que cadre coas rede de dependencias e os "
"recursos dispoñibles.<p>Pode atpar máis información na  <a href=\"help:kplato"
"\">documentación</a> ou na rede en <a href=\"http://www.koffice.org/kplato"
"\">http://www.koffice.org/kplato</a></p>"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:100
msgid "Next: Tips"
msgstr "Seguinte: Suxestións"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:137
msgid "Editing tips."
msgstr "Editando suxestións."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:139
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<br><b>To</b> edit project data, different views and editors can be "
#| "selected in the View Selector docker.<br><b>The</b> views are generally "
#| "used to inspect data after the project has been scheduled. No data will "
#| "appear in the views if the project has not been scheduled. Scheduling is "
#| "done in the Schedules editor.<br><b>You</b> can edit attributes in the "
#| "various editors by selecting the item you want to edit (doubleclick or "
#| "press F2), or open a dialog using the context menu.</ul>"
msgid ""
"<br/><b>To</b> edit project data, different views and editors can be "
"selected in the View Selector docker.<br/><b>The</b> views are generally "
"used to inspect data after the project has been scheduled. No data will "
"appear in the views if the project has not been scheduled. Scheduling is "
"done in the Schedules editor.<br/><b>You</b> can edit attributes in the "
"various editors by selecting the item you want to edit (doubleclick or press "
"F2), or open a dialog using the context menu.</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<br><b>Para</b>editar os datos dun proxecto hai diferentes tipos de editores "
"que se poden escoller dende a dock de Ver Seleccionador.<br><b>As</b> vistas "
"úsanse habitualmente para inspeccionar os datos despois de que se asiganara "
"un calendario para o proxecto. Non aparecerán os datos nas vistas cando o "
"proxecto inda non fora planificado. A planificación faise no editor de "
"Planificación.<br><b>Pode</b> editar as propiedades nos varios editores "
"seleccionando o obxecto que quere editar (faga dobre clic ou prema F2), ou "
"abra un diálogo usando o menú contextual.</ul>"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:145
msgid "Next: Create a simple project"
msgstr "Seguinte: Crear un proxecto simple"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:180
msgid "Create the simplest project ever."
msgstr "Crea o proxecto máis simple de todos."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:182
#, kde-format
msgctxt "1=datetime"
msgid ""
"Select the task editor <em>Editors->Tasks</em>:<ul><li>Create a task by "
"selecting <em>Add Task</em> in the toolbar.</li><li>Set <em>Estimate Type</"
"em> to <em>Duration</em>.</li><li>Set <em>Estimate</em> to <em>8 hours</em>."
"</li><li>Set <em>Constraint</em> to <em>As Soon As Possible</em>.</li></"
"ul>Select the schedules editor <em>Editors->Schedules</em>:<ul><li>Create a "
"schedule by selecting <em>Add Schedule</em> in the toolbar.</"
"li><li>Calculate the schedule by selecting <em>Calculate</em> in the toolbar."
"</li></ul>The task should now have been scheduled to start %1 with a "
"duration of 8 hours. You can check this by selecting the gantt chart "
"<em>Views->Gantt</em>."
msgstr ""
"Escolla o editor de tarefas en <em>Editor->Tarefas</em>:<ul><li> Crea unha "
"tarefa escolléndoa con<em>Engadir tarefa</em> na barra de ferramentas.</"
"li><li> Estableza o <em>Tipo de estimación</em> como <em>Duración</em>.</"
"li><li>Estableza <em>Estimar</em> en <em>8 horas</em>.</li><li>Estableza "
"<em>Constrición</em> en <em>Tan pronto como sexa posible</em>.</li></"
"ul>Escolla o editor de planificación<em>Editores->Planificacións</em>:"
"<ul><li>Crea unha planificación seleccionando <em>Engadir planificación</em> "
"na barra de ferramentas.</ li><li>Calcule a planificación escollendo "
"<em>Calcular</em> na barra de ferramentas. </li></ul>A tarefa estará agora "
"marcada para comezar %1 cunha duración de 8 horas. Pode comprobalo "
"escollendo o gráfico de gannt dende<em>Vistas->Gantt</em>."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:198
msgid "Next: Resource allocation"
msgstr "Seguinte: Asiganción de recursos"

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:209
msgid "Allocate a resource to the task."
msgstr "Asignar un recurso a unha tarefa."

#: about/aboutpage.cpp:211
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgctxt "1=datetime"
#| msgid ""
#| "Select the task editor <em>Editors->Tasks</em>:<ul><li>Enter a name (e.g. "
#| "'John') in the <em>Allocation</em> column. (KPlato will automatically "
#| "create a resource with name 'John' under resource group 'Resources'.</"
#| "li><li>Set <em>Estimate Type</em> to <em>Effort</em>.</li></ul>Now you "
#| "need to schedule the project again with the new allocation:<br>Select the "
#| "schedules editor <em>Editors->Schedules</em> and calculate the schedule "
#| "by selecting <em>Calculate</em> in the toolbar.<p>The task should be "
#| "scheduled to start %1 with a duration of 8 hours. You can check this by "
#| "selecting the gantt chart <em>Views->Gantt</em>.<p>"
msgctxt "1=datetime"
msgid ""
"Select the task editor <em>Editors->Tasks</em>:<ul><li>Enter a name (e.g. "
"'John') in the <em>Allocation</em> column. (Plan will automatically create a "
"resource with name 'John' under resource group 'Resources'.</li><li>Set "
"<em>Estimate Type</em> to <em>Effort</em>.</li></ul>Now you need to schedule "
"the project again with the new allocation:<br/>Select the schedules editor "
"<em>Editors->Schedules</em> and calculate the schedule by selecting "
"<em>Calculate</em> in the toolbar.<p>The task should be scheduled to start "
"%1 with a duration of 8 hours. You can check this by selecting the gantt "
"chart <em>Views->Gantt</em>.<p>"
msgstr ""
"Escolla no editar de tarefas <em>Editores > Tarefas</em>:<ul><li>Introduza "
"un nome, como p.ex \"Sabela\" na columna de <em>Asignación</em>. KPlato vai "
"crear un recurso automaticamente  co nome de \"Sabela\" no grupo de "
"\"Recursos\".</li><li>Defina a <em>Tipo de estimación</em> en <em>Esforzo</"
"em>Esforzo</em>.</li></ul>Agora pode planificar o proxecto de novo coa nova "
"asignación:<br>Escolla o evitor de planificación con <em>Editores > "
"Planificacións</em> e calcule a planificación escollendo <em>Calcular</em> "
"na barra de ferramentas.<p>A tarefa debería estar planificada para comezar "
"en %1 cunha duración de 8 horas. Pode comprobar isto na gráfica de gannt "
"indo a <em>Vistas > Gannt<7em>.<p>"

